<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 18mm 20mm 22mm 25mm; }
  body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: #111; }
  .sender-line { font-size: 7pt; border-bottom: 0.5pt solid #555; display: inline-block; margin-top: 28mm; }
  .head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
  .recipient { margin-top: 3mm; line-height: 1.35; }
  .info { margin-top: 8mm; font-size: 9pt; text-align: right; line-height: 1.5; }
  h1 { font-size: 14pt; margin: 14mm 0 4mm; }
  table.items { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 4mm; }
  table.items th { text-align: left; border-bottom: 1pt solid #000; font-size: 9pt; padding: 1.5mm 1mm; }
  table.items td { padding: 1.3mm 1mm; border-bottom: 0.3pt solid #bbb; vertical-align: top; }
  .num { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }
  table.totals { margin-left: auto; margin-top: 5mm; border-collapse: collapse; }
  table.totals td { padding: 1mm 2mm; }
  table.totals tr.sum td { font-weight: bold; border-top: 1pt solid #000; }
  .notes { margin-top: 6mm; }
  footer { margin-top: 12mm; font-size: 7.5pt; color: #333; display: flex; gap: 10mm; border-top: 0.5pt solid #888; padding-top: 2mm; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="head">
  <div>
    <div class="sender-line">{{ doc.seller.name }} · {{ x.seller_street }} · {{ doc.seller.address.post_code }} {{ doc.seller.address.city }}</div>
    <div class="recipient">
      {{ doc.buyer.name }}<br>{{ x.buyer_street }}<br>{{ doc.buyer.address.post_code }} {{ doc.buyer.address.city }}
      {% if doc.buyer.address.country_code != "DE" %}<br>{{ doc.buyer.address.country_code }}{% endif %}
      {% if doc.buyer.vat_id %}<br>USt-IdNr.: {{ doc.buyer.vat_id }}{% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="info">
    <strong>{{ doc.seller.name }}</strong><br>{{ x.seller_street }}<br>{{ doc.seller.address.post_code }} {{ doc.seller.address.city }}<br>Tel. {{ x.seller_phone }}<br><br>
    {{ x.title or "Rechnung" }}snummer: {{ doc.number }}<br>
    Rechnungsdatum: {{ day(doc.issue_date) }}<br>
    Leistungsdatum: {{ day(doc.delivery_date) }}
  </div>
</div>

<h1>{{ x.title or "Rechnung" }} {{ doc.number }}</h1>
<p>Sehr geehrte Damen und Herren,<br>für die erbrachten Leistungen berechnen wir Ihnen:</p>

<table class="items">
  <thead><tr><th>Pos.</th><th>Bezeichnung</th><th class="num">Menge</th><th class="num">Einzelpreis</th>{% if doc.vat_breakdown|length > 1 %}<th class="num">USt.</th>{% endif %}<th class="num">Gesamt</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody>
  {% for line in doc.lines %}
    <tr><td>{{ line.id }}</td><td>{{ line.name }}</td><td class="num">{{ qty(line.quantity) }} {{ line.unit }}</td><td class="num">{{ amount(line.unit_price) }} {{ symbol }}</td>{% if doc.vat_breakdown|length > 1 %}<td class="num">{{ qty(line.vat_rate) }} %</td>{% endif %}<td class="num">{{ amount(line.net_amount) }} {{ symbol }}</td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>

<table class="totals">
  <tr><td>Nettobetrag</td><td class="num">{{ amount(doc.totals.net) }} {{ symbol }}</td></tr>
  {% if not x.no_vat_line %}
  {% for vat in doc.vat_breakdown %}
    <tr><td>zzgl. Umsatzsteuer {{ qty(vat.rate) }} %{% if doc.vat_breakdown|length > 1 %} auf {{ amount(vat.taxable_amount) }} {{ symbol }}{% endif %}</td><td class="num">{{ amount(vat.tax_amount) }} {{ symbol }}</td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
  {% endif %}
  <tr class="sum"><td>{{ "Gutschriftsbetrag" if x.title else "Rechnungsbetrag" }}</td><td class="num">{{ amount(doc.totals.gross) }} {{ symbol }}</td></tr>
</table>

<div class="notes">
  {% for note in x.notes %}<p>{{ note }}</p>{% endfor %}
  {% if x.terms %}<p>{{ x.terms }}</p>{% elif x.title %}<p>Der Betrag wird Ihrem Konto innerhalb von 10 Tagen gutgeschrieben.</p>{% else %}<p>Bitte überweisen Sie den Rechnungsbetrag bis zum {{ day(doc.due_date) }} auf das unten genannte Konto.</p>{% endif %}
  <p>Mit freundlichen Grüßen<br>{{ doc.seller.name }}</p>
</div>

<footer>
  <div>{{ doc.seller.name }}<br>{{ x.seller_street }}<br>{{ doc.seller.address.post_code }} {{ doc.seller.address.city }}</div>
  <div>{% if doc.seller.vat_id %}USt-IdNr.: {{ doc.seller.vat_id }}<br>{% endif %}Steuernummer: {{ doc.seller.tax_number }}</div>
  <div>Bankverbindung<br>IBAN: {{ doc.ibans[0] }}</div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
